  "transcript": [
    {
      "turn": 0,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Hello. I've had this cough for ages and I'm starting to worry about it."
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Can you tell me more about your cough — for example, is it a dry cough or do you have any phlegm?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 1,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "It's mostly a dry cough, but I've coughed up some phlegm with a few streaks of blood twice this week.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f01",
        "f03",
        "f05"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you noticed any other symptoms, such as chest pain, shortness of breath, or fatigue?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 2,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've felt a little short of breath climbing two flights of stairs. I haven't noticed any chest pain or fatigue.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f04"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent colds, flu, or upper respiratory infections?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 3,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I had a heavy cold five weeks ago, and it went away, but the cough stayed.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you been exposed to any irritants, such as smoke, dust, or chemicals, recently?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 4,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've been driving a van, and I think the dust in there has made the cough worse.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you experienced any changes in your cough, such as worsening at night or when lying down?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 5,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "Yes, the cough is worse at night and first thing in the morning. It also wakes me up about twice a week.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your health, such as weight loss, fever, or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 6,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've lost a bit of weight, about five pounds, but I haven't had a fever or night sweats.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you smoked cigarettes or been exposed to secondhand smoke regularly in the past?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 7,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I smoked ten a day for about ten years and stopped five years ago. I don't think I've been exposed to secondhand smoke regularly.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 8,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any previous lung problems, such as asthma, chronic bronchitis, or emphysema?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 8,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I had asthma as a child and grew out of it as a teenager. I don't think I've had any other lung problems.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f06"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 9,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your environment, such as moving houses, changes in air quality, or new pets?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 9,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I've been driving a van, and I think the dust in there has made the cough worse. I haven't had any other changes in my environment.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": [
        "f11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "turn": 10,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Have you had any recent changes in your medication or treatment for other health conditions?"
    },
    {
      "turn": 10,
      "role": "patient",
      "text": "I haven't had any changes in my medication or treatment for other health conditions.",
      "gate_selected_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "turn": 11,
      "role": "interviewer",
      "text": "Thank you for sharing all that information. You've described a persistent dry cough that has lasted several weeks, with some phlegm and occasional streaks of blood, worsening at night and in the morning, and waking you up a couple of times a week. You also mentioned a history of asthma in childhood, recent exposure to dust from driving a van, and a small amount of weight loss.  \n\n[HISTORY COMPLETE]"
    }
  ],
